<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT AND PRIVACY</view
  ><view class="heading">账户与隐私</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><view wx:if="{{loggedOut}}" class="card"
    ><view class="title">已有会话已退出</view
    ><view class="muted space">账户数据保留，重新登录后可继续查看。</view
    ><button class="button" bindtap="login">重新登录</button></view
  ><block wx:if="{{user}}"
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">个人昵称</view
      ><input
        class="field space"
        value="{{name}}"
        maxlength="16"
        bindinput="nameInput"
        placeholder="1—16字昵称"
      /><button
        class="button small"
        bindtap="rename"
        disabled="{{busy || !name}}"
      >
        保存昵称
      </button></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">数据使用说明 · 内部审核稿</view
      ><view class="caption space"
        >运营主体：{{config.operator.name || '待配置'}} ·
        联系方式：{{config.operator.contact || '待配置'}}</view
      ><view class="muted space"
        >保存登录关联、业务账户、任务、金币流水、演示申请、邀请关系、群消息进度及反馈、趣答与错题记录、个人游戏进度。本机保存会话与任务恢复信息、广告位预览次数和关闭冷却。不读取通讯录、位置或相册，不构建设备商业权重。</view
      ><view class="muted space"
        >导出包含本账户最近100条各类记录，不含微信openid、会话和密钥；更多金币流水可在记录页分页查看。群角色为运营管理的活动助手。</view
      ><view class="notice"
        >真实广告和付款未接入。正式运营前需填写企业主体、客服、处理目的、保存期限及适用平台隐私声明，完成法务与微信审核。</view
      ><button class="button light" bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{busy}}">
        导出最近账户记录</button
      ><button
        wx:if="{{exportText}}"
        class="button secondary"
        bindtap="copyExport"
      >
        复制导出JSON（写入剪贴板）
      </button></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="title">申请注销</view
      ><view wx:if="{{user.closureRequest}}" class="notice"
        >申请状态：{{closureLabel}} {{user.closureRequest.decision || ''}}</view
      ><view class="muted space"
        >先处理已入账余额、冻结申请和未完成任务。未领取的开发奖励可在确认后放弃。申请处理中暂停新增奖励；审核通过后移除登录关联及非账务文本，必要账务与审计保留，不承诺删除依法应保留的数据。</view
      ><textarea
        class="feedback-input space"
        value="{{reason}}"
        maxlength="200"
        bindinput="reasonInput"
        placeholder="填写2—200字申请原因"
      /><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"
        ><label class="caption"
          ><checkbox
            value="yes"
          />我确认放弃未领取的开发奖励并了解保留范围</label
        ></checkbox-group
      ><button
        class="button secondary"
        bindtap="closure"
        disabled="{{busy || !agreed || reason.length < 2 || user.balance || user.frozen || user.pendingTask || user.closureRequest.state === 'pending'}}"
      >
        提交注销申请
      </button></view
    ><button class="button light" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">
      退出全部登录会话
    </button></block
  ></view
>
